# Tree Node

## Problem Summary

Write a query to classify each node in a tree as **Root**, **Inner**, or **Leaf** based on its parent-child relationship.

## Solution

```sql
SELECT id,
    CASE
        WHEN p_id IS NULL THEN 'Root'
        WHEN id IN (SELECT p_id FROM tree) THEN 'Inner'
        ELSE 'Leaf'
    END AS type
FROM tree;
```
